## 6. Security boundary

- **AuthN**: <how users/services authenticate>
- **AuthZ**: server-side, surfaced to UI via a `/me`-like endpoint
- **CSP**: restrictive; no inline scripts
- **Uploads**: via signed URLs (preferred) — the UI never writes directly to object storage
- **Downloads**: via short-lived signed URLs

Detail in [`SECURITY_AND_AUTH.md`](SECURITY_AND_AUTH.md).

